cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "KARADAVI — The Knowledge Forest"
type: software
abstract: "Public research and experimental specifications for KARADAVI, an open knowledge platform designed as a continuously evolving, entity-centered and knowledge-graph-first institution. The research explores canonical identity, extensible knowledge representation, claims, relationships, evidence, provenance, contextual authority, uncertainty, source reconciliation, revisions, and human-governed editorial publication."
repository-code: "https://github.com/aruntito/enterkaradavi"
url: "https://www.karadavi.com"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - open-knowledge
  - knowledge-graph
  - knowledge-representation
  - canonical-entities
  - entity-resolution
  - evidence
  - provenance
  - source-reconciliation
  - uncertainty
  - editorial-governance
  - machine-readable-knowledge
authors:
